WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.420
- [Alonzo] When I found Back on My Feet,

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.000
I was in a dark place.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.414
But I knew that if I can just run,

00:00:06.414 --> 00:00:07.750
(train tracks clacking)

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:08.969
things'd get better.

00:00:08.969 --> 00:00:11.552
(groovy music)

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:15.823
- [Man] Who are we?

00:00:15.823 --> 00:00:16.929
- [Group] Back on My Feet!

00:00:16.929 --> 00:00:17.851
- [Man] How long we gonna run?

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.400
- [Group] Forever!

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.070
- [Alonzo] Back on My Feet was a catalyst

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.274
for turning my life around.

00:00:22.274 --> 00:00:23.320
- [Woman] Look at that energy.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.813
- You just show up and
just get it out there.

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:30.340
Once you get that pace and your
body gets into another zone,

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.923
then you're a distance
runner. (breathes heavily)

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.520
When I'm running, I
think about my daughter.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.970
It's a spiritual connection.

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.830
When I was a kid, I waited
for my father to pick me up,

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:44.883
and he never showed.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:48.074
I don't want her to go
through what I went through.

00:00:48.074 --> 00:00:49.930
I want her to feel love.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.600
Name is Alonzo Harris.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.660
I'm just a humble man
looking for a better way.

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.882
That's 20, keep it moving.

00:00:55.882 --> 00:00:58.465
(groovy music)

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:09.124
(electronic chiming)

